{"abstract":[{"text":"Move a playback session between the immersive player and a window without losing the stream.","type":"text"}],"metadata":{"modules":[{"name":"YBVRAppleSDK"}],"title":"Switching Player Mode","roleHeading":"Article","role":"article"},"primaryContentSections":[{"content":[{"level":2,"text":"Overview","type":"heading","anchor":"Overview"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"A ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/applesdk.YBVRAppleSDK\/documentation\/YBVRAppleSDK\/YBVRPlayerManager","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" belongs to the rendering context it was built for. The context is","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"fixed at init through its ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/applesdk.YBVRAppleSDK\/documentation\/YBVRAppleSDK\/SurfaceContext","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":": a Compositor Services layer for the fully","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"rendered immersive player, a RealityKit entity for ","type":"text"},{"code":"VideoPlayerComponent","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" content, or no","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"context at all for the windowed Metal surface behind ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/applesdk.YBVRAppleSDK\/documentation\/YBVRAppleSDK\/GeometryVideoView","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":". None of those can","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"follow the viewer into a different scene, so letting someone move a video from an immersive","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"space into a window means building a second manager for the new surface.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"What that costs you is everything the first manager was holding: the playhead, whether it was"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"playing, the selected camera, the audio and subtitle languages, and which ad breaks have"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"already been seen. The manager cannot carry them across — it is going away — so hold that"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"state outside it, and put it back once the new manager is streaming. This guide covers the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"hand-over; ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/applesdk.YBVRAppleSDK\/documentation\/YBVRAppleSDK\/ContentSwitching"},{"type":"text","text":" is the different case of keeping one manager and changing"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the video underneath it."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"name":"Note","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The visionOS demo app in ","type":"text"},{"code":"Examples\/visionOS\/DemoApp","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" implements this end to end:","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"PlayerCoordinator","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" drives the swap, ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"PlaybackSession"},{"text":" holds the session across it,","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"code":"PlaybackRestorePoint","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" is the snapshot below, and "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"WindowPlayerView"},{"type":"text","text":" hosts the windowed"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"player. The session types live in "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Examples\/common"},{"type":"text","text":", shared with the iOS demo."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"type":"aside","style":"note"},{"level":2,"text":"Ending the Old Manager Without Ending the Content","type":"heading","anchor":"Ending-the-Old-Manager-Without-Ending-the-Content"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Take the state you need off the old manager, then tear it down with"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/applesdk.YBVRAppleSDK\/documentation\/YBVRAppleSDK\/YBVRPlayerManager\/stop(notifyEnded:)"},{"type":"text","text":". Pass "},{"code":"notifyEnded: false","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" so"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/applesdk.YBVRAppleSDK\/documentation\/YBVRAppleSDK\/YBVRPlayerManager\/isVideoEnded"},{"type":"text","text":" stays quiet — the video"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"is not over, and a host that dismisses its player UI on that signal would close the scene you"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"are about to move into:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["struct SessionState {","    let position: Double","    let isPlaying: Bool","    let cameraId: Int?","    let audioLanguage: String","    let subtitlesLanguage: String","    let playedAdBreakIds: Set<String>","}","","func snapshot(of player: YBVRPlayerManager) -> SessionState {","    SessionState(","        position: player.videoPosition.value,","        isPlaying: player.videoStatus.value != .paused,","        cameraId: player.currentCamera()?.id,","        audioLanguage: player.currentAudioLanguagePublisher.value,","        subtitlesLanguage: player.currentSubtitlesLanguagePublisher.value,","        playedAdBreakIds: player.ads.playedIds.value","    )","}","","pending = snapshot(of: player)","player.stop(notifyEnded: false)"]},{"anchor":"Restoring-on-the-New-Manager","type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Restoring on the New Manager"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Build the new manager with the surface context for the scene you are moving into, then replay"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the snapshot once "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/applesdk.YBVRAppleSDK\/documentation\/YBVRAppleSDK\/YBVRPlayerManager\/startStream(video:_:)","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" has returned:"}]},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["let player = YBVRPlayerManager(videoConfig: .defaultConfig, surfaceContext: context)","player.ads.markPlayed(pending.playedAdBreakIds)","","try await player.startStream(video: video, signaling)","","if let camera = pending.cameraId.flatMap({ id in player.cameras().first { $0.id == id } }) {","    await player.selectCamera(camera: camera)","}","if pending.position > 0 {","    player.seek(to: CMTimeMakeWithSeconds(pending.position, preferredTimescale: 1000))","}","await player.setAudioLanguage(language: pending.audioLanguage)","await player.setSubtitlesLanguage(language: pending.subtitlesLanguage)","","pending.isPlaying ? player.play() : player.pause()"]},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Seek once the stream is actually ready — waiting for "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/applesdk.YBVRAppleSDK\/documentation\/YBVRAppleSDK\/YBVRPlayerManager\/videoStatus"},{"type":"text","text":" to"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"report ","type":"text"},{"code":".ready","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" is enough — or the seek lands on an item that has no seekable range yet.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Live content without time shifting cannot be resumed at a position; check","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/applesdk.YBVRAppleSDK\/documentation\/YBVRAppleSDK\/Video\/isTimeShiftingAllowed","isActive":true},{"text":" before restoring one, and let the new player join at the live","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"edge otherwise.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"level":2,"text":"Ads Across the Swap","anchor":"Ads-Across-the-Swap","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/applesdk.YBVRAppleSDK\/documentation\/YBVRAppleSDK\/YBVRAdController\/markPlayed(_:)","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" is the one restore step that has to happen "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"before","type":"text"}]},{"text":" the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"new manager opens its stream, so call it as soon as the manager exists.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Two things go wrong without it. A pre-roll is armed at position zero on the fresh manager and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"plays again the moment content starts. And the restore seek jumps forward over any mid-roll"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the viewer has already watched, which is indistinguishable from someone skipping over one —"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"so "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/applesdk.YBVRAppleSDK\/documentation\/YBVRAppleSDK\/YBVRAdController\/playsMissedMidRollsOnSeek","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" re-arms it and it plays a second time."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Marking the ids from "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/applesdk.YBVRAppleSDK\/documentation\/YBVRAppleSDK\/YBVRAdController\/playedIds","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" drops those breaks from the schedule and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"takes them out of the catch-up."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The schedule itself does not survive either: hand the new manager its breaks with","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/applesdk.YBVRAppleSDK\/documentation\/YBVRAppleSDK\/YBVRAdController\/schedule(_:)","type":"reference"},{"text":" the same way you did the first one. Order does not matter —","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"marking before or after scheduling both work, and so does marking before the stream opens.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"level":2,"anchor":"Surfaces-Draw-Different-Things","text":"Surfaces Draw Different Things","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Not every surface renders the same overlays, so what your UI has to supply changes with the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"mode. Ask the manager rather than assuming:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/applesdk.YBVRAppleSDK\/documentation\/YBVRAppleSDK\/YBVRPlayerManager\/surfaceRendersSubtitles","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" is "},{"code":"true","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" for the immersive Compositor","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Services renderer, which burns cues into the video. On the windowed and RealityKit surfaces","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"it is ","type":"text"},{"code":"false","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", and the cue from ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/applesdk.YBVRAppleSDK\/documentation\/YBVRAppleSDK\/YBVRPlayerManager\/currentSubtitleCue","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":" is yours to place.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/applesdk.YBVRAppleSDK\/documentation\/YBVRAppleSDK\/YBVRPlayerManager\/surfaceRendersControlRoomMiniScreens","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" says whether"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/applesdk.YBVRAppleSDK\/documentation\/YBVRAppleSDK\/YBVRPlayerManager\/showCRMiniScreens(_:)","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/applesdk.YBVRAppleSDK\/documentation\/YBVRAppleSDK\/YBVRPlayerManager\/hitTestCRMiniScreen(rayDirection:)","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" do anything. Where it is "},{"code":"false","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":","},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"build the mini screens from "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/applesdk.YBVRAppleSDK\/documentation\/YBVRAppleSDK\/YBVRPlayerManager\/controlRoomSelectorViewModel()","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" with"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/applesdk.YBVRAppleSDK\/documentation\/YBVRAppleSDK\/ControlRoomView","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"text":"Re-binding Your Subscriptions","anchor":"Re-binding-Your-Subscriptions","type":"heading","level":2},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Every publisher you were observing belonged to the old manager. Cancel those subscriptions as"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"part of the swap and re-subscribe to the new manager, exactly as you would around a content"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"switch. Anything you cached — the surface controller from"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/applesdk.YBVRAppleSDK\/documentation\/YBVRAppleSDK\/YBVRPlayerManager\/getSurfaceController()","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":", a control room view model, a renderer — has to"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"be re-read too."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"A counter that increments on every swap makes this easy to drive from SwiftUI: observe it,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"and rebuild your bindings whenever it changes."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"kind":"content"}],"kind":"article","variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/ybvrapplesdk\/switchingplayermode"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"sections":[],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/applesdk.YBVRAppleSDK\/documentation\/YBVRAppleSDK\/SwitchingPlayerMode"},"seeAlsoSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/applesdk.YBVRAppleSDK\/documentation\/YBVRAppleSDK\/ContentSwitching","doc:\/\/applesdk.YBVRAppleSDK\/documentation\/YBVRAppleSDK\/AdInsertion","doc:\/\/applesdk.YBVRAppleSDK\/documentation\/YBVRAppleSDK\/Drm"],"generated":true,"title":"Guides","anchor":"Guides"}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/applesdk.YBVRAppleSDK\/documentation\/YBVRAppleSDK"]]},"references":{"doc://applesdk.YBVR